字化平台 FCC 及相关体系管理平台。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-13T11:21:32","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"5b7e9f0a-c52b-4357-bc2e-b19a05d8451c","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310273195,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"海外风电项目经理01(J22684)","OrgId":2842603,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.主导国际大型风电项目全流程管控，从投标策划、合同谈判到交付验收、质保运维，确保项目按期、按预算达成盈利目标​。\n2.运用项目管理平台，制定计划与进度管控，统筹生产、物流、施工等跨环节协同​。\n3.对接海外客户高层，维护战略级客户、现场业主关系，了解客户需求，提升客户满意度。\n4.统筹协调公司全产业链资源，协调技术、供应链、运维资源，保障项目高效推进​。\n5.联动法务、财务团队，建立动态风险管理矩阵，现风险闭环管理​，采取系统、有效的措施规避项目执行风险。\n6.组建并领导跨国项目团队，制定跨文化协作机制，赋能团队成员成长，打造高绩效执行团队​。\n7.熟悉 FIDIC 条款与国际风电合同规则，主导合同变更管理、争议解决，防范政治、汇率、合规等跨境风险 。\n8.参与公司全球化战略落地，输出海外项目最佳实践，优化公司国际项目管理体系​。","Require":"任职资格 - 期待与你一道，赋能国际风电项目高效落地！\n1.本科及以上学历，电气工程、机械工程、风能与动力工程、工程管理等相关专业。\n2. 10 年以上工作经验，8年以上国际工程项目经验，拥有独立主导执行国际工程经验。\n3.熟悉项目执行业务流程（生产组织、物流发运、现场施工、项目交接）及对应行为标准。\n4.具有商务意识，熟悉FIDIC条款，可有效解决项目争议，并有过类似争端解决经验。\n5.5年以上跨国团队管理经验，有较强的沟通协调能力。\n6.具有项目管理资格认证，持有 PMP 证书优先考虑。\n7.熟练的英文听说读写能力：英文合同的阅读理解能力，流畅的沟通项目各项工作（雅思 6.0 分以上，新托福 80 分以上，或同等水平）；\n8.熟练使用办公软件及项目管理软件， 及相关体系管理平台。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-08T20:50:23","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null}],"Total":0}